{"version":"activity-event.v1","id":"AEV-260830-616858e4aefee224e9cc890a","sequence":5,"timestamp":"2026-08-30T00:01:22.00243Z","actor":{"principal":{"availability":"unknown"},"agent":{"availability":"known","value":"codex"},"run":{"availability":"unknown"},"session":{"availability":"known","value":"01a04fe2-28d3-71a3-b6d8-025482bdd61c"},"operator":{"availability":"unknown"}},"subject":{"element_id":"TASK-260830-1l74m8","element_type":"task"},"source":{"kind":"local_cli","entrypoint":"cmd.runMutate","request":{"availability":"unknown"}},"correlation_id":"COR-260830-b2284bca55da64e5ad65a952","causal_order":1,"operation":"progress","changes":[{"field":"notes","before":{"kind":"text","text":""},"after":{"kind":"text","text":"Implemented source and installed runtime update from 1M/900K to 272K/245K. Rationale: OpenAI Docs list GPT-5.6 Sol long-context pricing as starting when prompts exceed 272K input tokens; no official compact-limit recommendation was found, so 245000 keeps the same approximate 90% headroom pattern as the prior 900000/1000000 config while staying below the threshold. Changed .configs/codex-config.toml root keys to model_context_window=272000 and model_auto_compact_token_limit=245000 before any TOML table; GPT-5.6 Sol remains selected. README documents the values and headroom. Updated setup tests to assert the new defaults. Preserved pre-existing installed local state by adding the agent-session-manager trust entry and tui.status_line settings to source before syncing. Synced with agents-infra setup global --source-dir /Users/iv/Developer/IV/relux-agents-infra. Validation: python tomllib source+installed ok; focused go test ./internal/infra ok; go test ./... -count=1 ok; go vet ./... ok; git diff --check ok; agents-infra doctor global ok. task-board validate logs 480 pre-existing MISSING_RESOURCE_PAYLOAD records already tracked as board debt, unrelated to this config change."}}]}
